This assignment requires you to write code for a cooling simulation involving rooms and
devices. Three types of devices can be used to cool a room: air conditioners, ceiling fans, and
standing fans. Air conditioners and ceiling fans cannot be removed from a room once they are added.
Standing fans however are portable devices that can be swapped between rooms only if they are not
in use. The table below shows the different properties of each device: portability, breeziness,
noisiness, and cooling power

