Device - Air Conditioner - Portable  = no, Breeziness = 0, Noisiness = 0, Cools by = 5.
Device - Ceiling Fan- Portable  = no, Breeziness = 2, Noisiness = 0, Cools by = 3.
Device - Standing Fan- Portable  = Yes, Breeziness = 2, Noisiness = 2, Cools by = 1.

