    void turnOff();

    int coolsBy();

    int getBreeziness();

    int getNoisiness();

}

PortableDevice Interface
The PortableDevice interface does not specify any behaviour. It allows a standing fan to be subtyped
as a PortableDevice.

public interface PortableDevice {
boolean isPortable();

void setPortable(boolean isPortable);
}

